   "titulo": "The known first",
   "texto": [
    "If you ask «Who called?», the answer stands out: **Мой брат позвонил** (my brother called). If you ask «What did your brother do?», the answer highlights the action: **Брат позвонил** (the brother called)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Emphasis",
   "texto": [
    "The Russian order is flexible and helps to mark theme and focus, but there is no fixed rule that «The most important thing goes to the end»: influence context and intonation.",
    "Compare **Я купил книгу вчера** (yesterday I bought a book; the focus may be the time) with **Книгу я купил вчера** (the book did buy it yesterday; the object stands out or contrasts)."
   ]
